@startuml 1_level
title EF800 — System Context and Level 1 Blocks
left to right direction

actor Operator
actor Developer
rectangle "Service PC / USB host" as pc
rectangle "External instruments\nUART / serial" as instruments
rectangle "Browser" as browser
rectangle "Virtual EF800 gateway\nHTTP + WebSocket" as gateway

package "EF800 measurement instrument" {
  rectangle "Second-level\nBootloader" as boot
  rectangle "EF800Application\nmeasurement + UI" as main
  rectangle "BackupApplication\nrecovery MTP" as backup
  rectangle "STM32L431 keyboard\ncontroller" as keyboard
  database "L496 internal flash\nBoot / Backup / Main" as iflash
  database "External QSPI\nNVS / Configuration / Data" as qspi
  rectangle "Front panel\nLCD + controls" as frontpanel
}

Operator --> frontpanel : keypad input
main --> frontpanel : render display
main <--> keyboard : keyboard UART
main <--> instruments : measurement protocols
pc <--> main : named-root MTP\noptional exclusive MSC
pc <--> backup : recovery MTP
boot --> iflash : validate / update / select
boot --> qspi : boot state + update file
main <--> qspi : settings / workspaces / plugins
backup <--> qspi : recovery files
boot --> main : normal handoff
boot --> backup : recovery handoff
Developer --> gateway : development UI
browser <--> gateway : HTTP / WebSocket
gateway <--> main : bounded private simulator protocol

@enduml
